# AllSearch Local — environment
#
# Inherited from the SaaS. Almost all of it is being deleted: see
# .scratch/local-app-migration/spec.md. Nothing here is a user-facing setting.
#
# The user's AI provider keys deliberately do NOT live in this file. They are
# entered in the app's settings screen and stored locally (see issue 08 and
# ADR 0004), because a desktop app cannot ask its user to edit a dotfile.
#
# The original .env.local was NOT copied across: it held live production
# credentials. Rotate them all when the SaaS is sunset.

# ─── Survives ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Where the SQLite database lives. Defaults to the platform application-data
# directory (~/Library/Application Support/AllSearch/allsearch.db on macOS).
# Override for tests. See issue 04.
# ALLSEARCH_DB_PATH=

# Playwright target. See issue 21.
# PLAYWRIGHT_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000

# ─── Deleted in issue 02: Supabase ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Replaced by SQLite (ADR 0006).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_DEFAULT_KEY=
# SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=                      # service role, bypassed RLS

# ─── Deleted in issue 07: Vercel AI Gateway ──────────────────────────────────
# NOTE: this never appeared in the source. libs/ai/models.ts calls
# createGateway() with no arguments, so the AI SDK reads it from the
# environment implicitly. It is invisible to grep, which is exactly why it is
# recorded here. Replaced by direct provider keys (ADR 0004).
# AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=
# VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN=                        # gateway auth fallback on Vercel

# ─── Deleted in issue 02: billing ────────────────────────────────────────────
# LEMONSQUEEZY_API_KEY=
# LEMONSQUEEZY_SIGNING_SECRET=
# LEMONSQUEEZY_STORE_ID=

# ─── Deleted in issue 02: telemetry and support ──────────────────────────────
# No telemetry of any kind. Nothing leaves the machine.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_HOST=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CRISP_WEBSITE_ID=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_TAG_MANAGER_ID=

# ─── Deleted in issue 17: hosted environments ────────────────────────────────
# There is one environment now.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_VERCEL_ENV=
